---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Aapka apna help platform</span>
        <h1>Pareshani koi bhi ho, <em>raasta zaroor milega.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Kabhi-kabhi ek chhoti si problem bhi bahut badi lagne lagti hai. Samajh nahi aata kahan jaana hai, kisse poochhna hai ya shuruaat kaise karni hai. Aap apni baat bataiye — HelpMeDost aapko sahi information aur agla practical step samajhne mein madad karega.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/request-help">Mujhe madad chahiye <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="button button-light" href="/track">Apni request track karein</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-line"><span>Aapki baat important hai</span><span>Saaf aur useful guidance</span><span>Ek jagah se shuruaat</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="HelpMeDost support illustration">
        <div class="art-blob"></div>
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="card-top"><div class="mini-avatar">👋</div><span class="status-pill">Hum sun rahe hain</span></div>
          <h3>Aapko har cheez akele figure out karne ki zaroorat nahi.</h3>
          <p>Jo problem hai, humein batayein. Hum use samajhne aur agla step dhoondhne mein aapki help karenge.</p>
          <div class="progress"><span></span></div>
          <p>Ek chhota step bhi aage badhne ki shuruaat hai.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-note">Aapki baat maayne rakhti hai <strong>♥</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Hum kis tarah help kar sakte hain?</span><h2>Har zaroorat ke liye, ek friendly starting point.</h2><p>Filhal hum Student Help Portal se shuruaat kar rahe hain. Dheere-dheere aur services aur support options add kiye jayenge.</p></div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🎓</div><h3>Student Help</h3><p>School admission, forms, education-related processes aur student questions mein guidance.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</div><h3>Parent Guidance</h3><p>Bachchon ki education aur school matters mein options samajhne aur sahi information dhoondhne mein help.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🧭</div><h3>Everyday Assistance</h3><p>Kisi process ko lekar confusion hai? Apni baat share karein, hum possible next steps samajhne mein help karenge.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">💻</div><h3>Digital Support</h3><p>Online forms, digital services aur technology ko safely use karne se judi basic guidance.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🤝</div><h3>Sahi Support Tak Pahunch</h3><p>Jahan zaroorat ho, wahan suitable aur verified support options tak pahunchne mein madad.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">💬</div><h3>Central Helpdesk</h3><p>Alag-alag jagah bhatakne ke bajaye, apni request ek jagah se shuru karein.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft-section" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Process simple rakha hai</span><h2>Madad maangne ke liye bas 3 steps.</h2><p>Aapko apni problem baar-baar explain na karni pade, isliye har request ko ek unique reference number diya jata hai.</p></div>
      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step"><span class="step-num">01</span><h3>Apni baat batayein</h3><p>Topic choose karein aur simple words mein batayein ki aapko kis cheez mein help chahiye.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><span class="step-num">02</span><h3>Reference number sambhal kar rakhein</h3><p>Request submit hone ke baad mile unique number ko save kar lein.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><span class="step-num">03</span><h3>Update check karein</h3><p>Apne reference number se request ka status check kar sakte hain.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-band">
        <div><h2>Samajh nahi aa raha kahan se shuru karein?</h2><p>Koi baat nahi. Pehla step bas apni problem batana hai. Hum aapki request ko sahi direction dene ki koshish karenge.</p></div>
        <a class="button button-light" href="/request-help">Apni baat share karein <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
